1
00:01:36,210 --> 00:01:40,070
[River of No Return]

2
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:43,000
[Episode 2:
The Crown Prince and the Constable]

3
00:01:44,370 --> 00:01:46,240
You've got quite a temper, don't you?

4
00:01:46,240 --> 00:01:47,500
Refusing to talk, huh?

5
00:01:52,630 --> 00:01:53,830
Let me put it this way.

6
00:01:53,979 --> 00:01:55,580
If I take you to the yamen now,

7
00:01:55,780 --> 00:01:58,110
and say you're the one
who blew up the boat,

8
00:01:58,710 --> 00:02:00,060
you'll get the death penalty.

9
00:02:00,060 --> 00:02:01,120
Do you understand?

10
00:02:06,570 --> 00:02:07,520
Playing dead

11
00:02:07,620 --> 00:02:09,880
and giving me the silent treatment, huh?

12
00:02:09,910 --> 00:02:10,910
Fine. Come on.

13
00:02:17,980 --> 00:02:19,380
It's a piece of fine jade.

14
00:02:20,510 --> 00:02:21,840
"Accurate to the inch"?

15
00:02:21,910 --> 00:02:22,910
What does it mean?

16
00:02:25,950 --> 00:02:27,410
Why are you laughing at me?

17
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:30,600
Don't you Jinling constables
ever read a book?

18
00:02:31,730 --> 00:02:32,880
Cut the crap.

19
00:02:34,700 --> 00:02:35,210
Go!

20
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:36,750
♪ Along the Qinhuai River in Nanjing ♪

21
00:02:36,380 --> 00:02:40,750
[Zhengyang Gate]

22
00:02:36,790 --> 00:02:38,290
♪ I patrol the streets,
swaying along day after day ♪

23
00:02:38,350 --> 00:02:39,579
♪ A jug of wine in hand,
a blade of grass between my teeth ♪

24
00:02:39,610 --> 00:02:41,050
♪ Even the rowdiest ghosts run
when they see me ♪

25
00:02:41,110 --> 00:02:42,460
♪ Don't ask me what I'm after ♪

26
00:02:41,790 --> 00:02:42,540
Lift your feet!

27
00:02:42,480 --> 00:02:43,920
♪ Honestly, I don't even know ♪

28
00:02:43,140 --> 00:02:44,070
You'll break your neck.

29
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,090
♪ All I know is, there are some things ♪

30
00:02:45,110 --> 00:02:46,560
♪ I'd feel guilty if I didn't do ♪

31
00:02:46,579 --> 00:02:48,030
♪ I'm not cut out to be an official ♪

32
00:02:48,060 --> 00:02:49,490
♪ Nor am I one for playing tricks ♪

33
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,840
♪ When it's time to act, I act ♪

34
00:02:50,860 --> 00:02:52,210
♪ I play it straight, no funny business ♪

35
00:02:55,850 --> 00:02:56,790
Hurry up.

36
00:03:01,140 --> 00:03:02,400
What's your business?

37
00:03:02,490 --> 00:03:03,970
I'm from the Yingtian Prefectural Office.

38
00:03:03,970 --> 00:03:05,510
I'm taking a prisoner into the city.

39
00:03:05,510 --> 00:03:06,570
Take another gate.

40
00:03:06,910 --> 00:03:07,950
This gate's unsafe.

41
00:03:07,950 --> 00:03:09,080
No one gets through.

42
00:03:09,580 --> 00:03:10,310
Unsafe?

43
00:03:12,010 --> 00:03:12,790
No way.

44
00:03:12,880 --> 00:03:15,150
This prisoner must be delivered into
custody immediately.

45
00:03:15,150 --> 00:03:16,060
No delays.

46
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:18,760
Are you deaf or what?

47
00:03:20,470 --> 00:03:21,790
Let me tell you,

48
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:26,329
he may be a suspect in the
Crown Prince's attempted assassination.

49
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:27,290
Can you

50
00:03:27,700 --> 00:03:29,160
take the responsibility?

51
00:03:29,540 --> 00:03:31,100
Let me make it clear first.

52
00:03:31,450 --> 00:03:33,310
You insisted on passing through.

53
00:03:33,329 --> 00:03:35,390
Don't blame me if something happens!

54
00:03:36,980 --> 00:03:38,380
Something happens to me?

55
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:41,100
I'm afraid nothing will happen to me.

56
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:43,750
Are you scared?

57
00:03:45,970 --> 00:03:46,900
He's not scared.

58
00:03:47,230 --> 00:03:47,910
It's fine.

59
00:03:49,140 --> 00:03:49,630
Go.

60
00:03:55,090 --> 00:03:55,579
Go.

61
00:04:15,970 --> 00:04:17,310
♪ Swaying along, swaying along ♪

62
00:04:17,339 --> 00:04:18,630
♪ Swaying along, swaying along ♪

63
00:04:18,649 --> 00:04:20,160
♪ Swaying along—
what's all the swaying for? ♪

64
00:04:20,230 --> 00:04:22,110
Did I say you could go?

65
00:04:21,410 --> 00:04:22,650
♪ Chasing them down, chasing them down ♪

66
00:04:22,730 --> 00:04:23,780
Haven't you had enough of a beating?

67
00:04:22,780 --> 00:04:24,020
♪ Chasing them down, chasing them down ♪

68
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:26,270
♪ Chasing them down—
what am I chasing for? ♪

69
00:04:26,860 --> 00:04:28,450
♪ Who knows? Who cares about me? ♪

70
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:29,880
♪ Who knows? Who cares about me? ♪

71
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,220
Move.

72
00:04:29,990 --> 00:04:31,690
♪ Who knows where home is? ♪

73
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:33,960
♪ To hell with princes and nobles ♪

74
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:35,390
♪ To hell with
what the history books say ♪

75
00:04:35,420 --> 00:04:37,330
♪ I'm my own guardian angel ♪

76
00:04:48,690 --> 00:04:49,780
Behave yourself.

77
00:04:53,670 --> 00:04:57,260
[Wu Yulu, Wu Buping's daughter]

78
00:04:54,340 --> 00:04:54,940
Dingyuan.

79
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:56,560
Dingyuan!

80
00:04:59,020 --> 00:04:59,620
Dingyuan!

81
00:05:00,220 --> 00:05:00,780
Yulu?

82
00:05:01,400 --> 00:05:02,260
Stop there!

83
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:03,580
Why are you here?

84
00:05:03,580 --> 00:05:04,970
Father sent someone home to look for you.

85
00:05:04,970 --> 00:05:06,510
They said you weren't at Shangutai.

86
00:05:06,510 --> 00:05:07,720
The treasure ship was blown up

87
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:09,720
and he was worried you might be hurt.

88
00:05:11,170 --> 00:05:13,320
I was investigating the case
with Father that morning.

89
00:05:13,320 --> 00:05:15,260
That room was full of gunpowder,

90
00:05:15,310 --> 00:05:16,770
but it didn't even hurt me.

91
00:05:17,020 --> 00:05:18,110
Behave yourself.

92
00:05:19,490 --> 00:05:20,470
It was half a river away.

93
00:05:20,470 --> 00:05:21,860
How could it hurt me?

94
00:05:22,050 --> 00:05:23,510
I‘m lucky.

95
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:25,850
Brother,

96
00:05:26,690 --> 00:05:27,380
Who is this?

97
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:29,630
This guy

98
00:05:31,350 --> 00:05:34,210
has something to do with the explosion
of the Crown Prince's treasure ship.

99
00:05:34,210 --> 00:05:36,840
I'm taking him
to the Yingtian Prefectural Office now.

100
00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:38,340
Father sent word

101
00:05:38,870 --> 00:05:40,360
that all the officials
from Yingtian Prefecture

102
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:42,170
were wiped out at Dongshuiguan.

103
00:05:42,500 --> 00:05:44,870
If no one's
at the Yingtian Prefectural Office,

104
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:46,930
I'll take him to the Imperial Guards.

105
00:05:47,070 --> 00:05:49,270
Maybe I'll even pocket a little reward.

106
00:05:49,780 --> 00:05:50,340
Alright.

107
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:51,300
It's a mess outside.

108
00:05:51,300 --> 00:05:52,000
Go home now.

109
00:05:52,820 --> 00:05:53,460
Okay.

110
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:55,820
Let's go.

111
00:06:00,050 --> 00:06:00,870
Go.

112
00:06:03,140 --> 00:06:03,900
I'll kick you.

113
00:06:03,900 --> 00:06:05,100
The court is in crisis,

114
00:06:04,220 --> 00:06:08,090
[Imperial Guards Headquarters]

115
00:06:05,490 --> 00:06:06,960
and you dare turn a blind eye?

116
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:08,130
We're on our way to help the victims now.

117
00:06:08,130 --> 00:06:10,390
The Imperial Guards' duty isn't rescue.

118
00:06:10,670 --> 00:06:13,030
It's to track down the culprits
as quickly as possible!

119
00:06:13,030 --> 00:06:13,700
If

120
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:15,360
you delay us,

121
00:06:14,530 --> 00:06:18,690
[Yu Qian, Director of Messenger's Office]

122
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:16,770
every one of you

123
00:06:17,630 --> 00:06:19,090
will be guilty of treason!

124
00:06:19,870 --> 00:06:22,430
You're just a lowly Messenger Director
from the Messenger's Office,

125
00:06:22,430 --> 00:06:24,430
yet you talk like a grand secretary,

126
00:06:24,460 --> 00:06:26,250
coming here to tell us what to do!

127
00:06:26,250 --> 00:06:28,580
I'm Wu Dingyuan,
a constable with the Yingtian Prefecture.

128
00:06:28,580 --> 00:06:30,110
I caught one suspect

129
00:06:30,190 --> 00:06:31,400
at the scene
of the Crown Prince's ship explosion,

130
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:33,000
and I'm here to hand him over.

131
00:06:38,550 --> 00:06:39,100
Wait.

132
00:06:41,930 --> 00:06:43,700
Why do you have this jade pendant?

133
00:06:43,700 --> 00:06:44,960
Don't touch my things.

134
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:48,140
This can't be yours.

135
00:06:55,020 --> 00:06:56,420
Did you steal it or rob it?

136
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:57,580
Tell the truth.

137
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:10,820
I found it on this punk.

138
00:07:12,580 --> 00:07:13,310
Give it to me.

139
00:07:22,930 --> 00:07:23,780
Hurry up.

140
00:07:24,510 --> 00:07:25,380
Brother Shen.

141
00:07:28,580 --> 00:07:30,070
I am Yu Qian, Yu Tingyi.

142
00:07:36,350 --> 00:07:39,170
Since you took the high position
as a subordinate of the Crown Prince

143
00:07:39,170 --> 00:07:40,260
to assist the Eastern Palace,

144
00:07:40,260 --> 00:07:41,990
we haven't seen each other for years.

145
00:07:41,990 --> 00:07:43,390
Do you still remember me?

146
00:07:48,060 --> 00:07:49,860
Do you two know each other or not?

147
00:07:50,100 --> 00:07:51,760
Don't put on a show for me here.

148
00:07:53,380 --> 00:07:54,580
Of course I remember.

149
00:07:54,990 --> 00:07:56,790
Where is Zheng He, Zheng Sanbao?

150
00:08:03,630 --> 00:08:06,260
Go report to the Garrison Eunuch,
Lord Zheng He, immediately.

151
00:08:06,260 --> 00:08:06,950
Tell him

152
00:08:07,810 --> 00:08:10,580
that Shen Lian, the Crown Prince's
subordinate, has been found,

153
00:08:10,580 --> 00:08:12,510
and ask him to come meet him at once.

154
00:08:27,190 --> 00:08:28,120
Arrest this man!

155
00:08:31,020 --> 00:08:31,490
Brothers,

156
00:08:31,490 --> 00:08:32,909
I'm just here to hand over a prisoner!

157
00:08:32,909 --> 00:08:34,080
You've got the wrong man!

158
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,860
I'm just here to hand over a prisoner!

159
00:08:35,860 --> 00:08:37,260
You've got the wrong man!

160
00:08:41,169 --> 00:08:43,150
How did you know my identity?

161
00:08:44,430 --> 00:08:45,290
Your Highness,

162
00:08:45,910 --> 00:08:48,530
I passed the imperial examinations
in the 19th year of the Yongle reign.

163
00:08:48,530 --> 00:08:51,550
I saw Emperor Taizong
during the palace examination.

164
00:08:52,340 --> 00:08:53,670
You and Emperor Taizong

165
00:08:53,810 --> 00:08:55,220
look exactly alike.

166
00:08:56,860 --> 00:08:58,740
The four characters
on that jade pendant...

167
00:08:58,740 --> 00:09:00,200
I also know their meaning.

168
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:01,580
Besides,

169
00:09:01,980 --> 00:09:04,190
no one in Jinling City

170
00:09:04,810 --> 00:09:06,740
who can call Lord Zheng by his name.

171
00:09:08,550 --> 00:09:09,580
I heard

172
00:09:10,460 --> 00:09:14,150
that the officials welcoming me
at Dongshui Pass are either dead or injured.

173
00:09:14,150 --> 00:09:16,220
Is Zheng He still safe?

174
00:09:16,820 --> 00:09:18,070
When the incident happened, his guards

175
00:09:18,070 --> 00:09:19,470
all stood in front of him,

176
00:09:19,670 --> 00:09:20,620
so Lord Zheng

177
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:22,370
didn't suffer much impact.

178
00:09:22,430 --> 00:09:23,430
I was not far away,

179
00:09:23,670 --> 00:09:25,340
so I saw it with my own eyes.

180
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:28,190
Go on.

181
00:09:30,690 --> 00:09:31,550
Your Highness,

182
00:09:32,620 --> 00:09:33,580
I believe

183
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,790
at this treacherous time,

184
00:09:36,430 --> 00:09:39,070
the only person in Jinling City

185
00:09:39,970 --> 00:09:41,330
is Lord Zheng.

186
00:09:53,030 --> 00:09:54,390
Do you know that man,

187
00:09:55,070 --> 00:09:55,910
Wu Dingyuan?

188
00:09:57,170 --> 00:09:58,070
I do.

189
00:09:59,100 --> 00:10:00,150
He has a nickname,

190
00:10:00,620 --> 00:10:01,880
"Good-for-nothing".

191
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:03,840
He's useless, a man
who'll never amount to anything.

192
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:05,290
Without his father's influence,

193
00:10:05,290 --> 00:10:08,620
he'd never have become a constable
in Yingtian Prefecture.

194
00:10:09,820 --> 00:10:11,480
The one with a real reputation

195
00:10:11,860 --> 00:10:13,290
is his father, "Iron Lion"

196
00:10:13,290 --> 00:10:15,310
Wu Buping, chief constable overseeing

197
00:10:15,310 --> 00:10:18,040
all three divisions
of the Yingtian Prefecture.

198
00:10:23,740 --> 00:10:24,310
Come.

199
00:10:25,650 --> 00:10:26,670
Raise your head.

200
00:10:34,950 --> 00:10:36,550
Go do something for me.

201
00:10:39,150 --> 00:10:40,210
Do you understand?

202
00:10:51,790 --> 00:10:53,600
"Accurate to the inch"?

203
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:55,570
It's a piece of good jade.

204
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,850
♪ Along the Qinhuai River in Nanjing ♪

205
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:58,150
This can't be yours.

206
00:10:56,870 --> 00:10:58,580
♪ I patrol the streets,
swaying along day after day ♪

207
00:10:58,550 --> 00:11:00,980
Since you took the high position
as a subordinate of the Crown Prince

208
00:10:58,620 --> 00:11:00,340
♪ A jug of wine in hand,
a blade of grass between my teeth ♪

209
00:11:00,430 --> 00:11:02,100
♪ Even the rowdiest ghosts run
when they see me ♪

210
00:11:01,310 --> 00:11:02,190
and began serving the Eastern Palace,

211
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,630
♪ Through storms and flames, I press on ♪

212
00:11:02,910 --> 00:11:04,220
we haven't seen each other for years.

213
00:11:03,650 --> 00:11:05,390
♪ I drag my life along like a rope ♪

214
00:11:05,410 --> 00:11:06,970
♪ They call me a young constable ♪

215
00:11:05,500 --> 00:11:06,900
Do you still remember me?

216
00:11:07,030 --> 00:11:07,980
Of course I do.

217
00:11:07,100 --> 00:11:08,830
♪ But this realm isn't mine to rule ♪

218
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:10,000
Where is Zheng He, Zheng Sanbao?

219
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,530
♪ Isn't mine to rule ♪

220
00:11:13,670 --> 00:11:15,030
No way.

221
00:11:15,870 --> 00:11:18,000
Did I really run into the Crown Prince?

222
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:30,090
Wu Dingyuan,

223
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:32,290
you were at the scene
when the treasure ship exploded.

224
00:11:32,290 --> 00:11:33,700
Tell us what you know.

225
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:36,820
How are you connected to the case?

226
00:11:37,270 --> 00:11:38,740
What are you asking me?

227
00:11:39,100 --> 00:11:40,220
I don't understand.

228
00:11:40,220 --> 00:11:41,480
How can I answer you?

229
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:42,930
Don't play dumb with me.

230
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:44,630
The current situation is critical,

231
00:11:44,630 --> 00:11:46,230
and people are losing heart.

232
00:11:46,670 --> 00:11:47,320
Let me tell you,

233
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,480
anyone who serves the state

234
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:50,600
has a duty to step up in times of crisis
and help those in danger.

235
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:52,050
Spare me

236
00:11:52,050 --> 00:11:53,700
the grand speeches.

237
00:11:54,530 --> 00:11:55,430
Save that stuff

238
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:57,860
for the bigwigs at court.

239
00:11:58,070 --> 00:11:59,000
I don't understand it,

240
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:00,310
and I don't care to.

241
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:02,930
For me, there are only two things
that matters:

242
00:12:02,930 --> 00:12:03,860
staying alive

243
00:12:04,080 --> 00:12:05,080
and making money.

244
00:12:14,070 --> 00:12:14,820
Alright.

245
00:12:16,030 --> 00:12:17,430
If you want to stay alive,

246
00:12:18,260 --> 00:12:20,790
you should answer
the questions truthfully.

247
00:12:29,410 --> 00:12:30,410
My two lords,

248
00:12:33,530 --> 00:12:34,620
do you two

249
00:12:35,820 --> 00:12:37,720
really take me for a fool?

250
00:12:38,390 --> 00:12:40,320
With such a big commotion outside,

251
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:43,570
do you really think our
Yingtian Prefectural Office can handle it?

252
00:12:43,570 --> 00:12:45,620
Do you really want
the Yingtian Prefectural Office

253
00:12:45,620 --> 00:12:47,570
and my father to take the blame?

254
00:12:48,530 --> 00:12:49,790
What are you thinking?

255
00:12:49,940 --> 00:12:51,100
Is it that easy?

256
00:12:51,450 --> 00:12:52,180
Wu Dingyuan,

257
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:55,290
you are the son
of Iron Lion after all.

258
00:12:55,290 --> 00:12:57,340
How can you disgrace your father
like this?

259
00:12:57,340 --> 00:12:59,650
Since you witnessed the bombing,

260
00:13:00,500 --> 00:13:01,580
and you're a constable.

261
00:13:01,580 --> 00:13:03,700
It's your duty to help us find out

262
00:13:03,790 --> 00:13:06,220
who's behind the attempt
on the Crown Prince's life.

263
00:13:06,220 --> 00:13:07,580
I have that duty, too?

264
00:13:08,670 --> 00:13:09,870
Answer the question!

265
00:13:10,310 --> 00:13:11,430
What happened

266
00:13:11,460 --> 00:13:12,860
to the Huliu explosive
stolen from the palace?

267
00:13:12,860 --> 00:13:14,390
You ask me. Who should I ask?

268
00:13:14,450 --> 00:13:15,390
I have no idea.

269
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:16,270
You...

270
00:13:19,630 --> 00:13:22,360
Can I ask you two a question first?

271
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:27,020
Is the Crown Prince

272
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:28,030
still alive?

273
00:13:37,860 --> 00:13:38,790
I think

274
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:41,200
if you two really want to know

275
00:13:41,500 --> 00:13:42,740
who this thief is,

276
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:45,250
find out who's behind this,

277
00:13:46,090 --> 00:13:48,610
just handle it the way

278
00:13:48,910 --> 00:13:50,440
the Crown Prince would have

279
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:52,000
while he was still alive.

280
00:13:52,050 --> 00:13:52,670
Get it?

281
00:14:03,180 --> 00:14:04,490
Release me quickly!

282
00:14:04,820 --> 00:14:06,500
You will definitely need me.

283
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:08,580
The day is not over yet.

284
00:14:22,620 --> 00:14:23,950
Greetings, Lord Zheng.

285
00:14:25,340 --> 00:14:27,190
Master Shen, the one and only master
of focus and integrity,

286
00:14:27,190 --> 00:14:28,250
is waiting inside.

287
00:14:51,890 --> 00:14:52,600
I, Zheng He,

288
00:14:53,170 --> 00:14:54,820
the eunuch in charge of
Jinling's defenses,

289
00:14:54,820 --> 00:14:56,680
pay my respects to Your Highness.

290
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:11,790
Sanbao,

291
00:15:14,090 --> 00:15:15,800
I finally see you.

292
00:15:21,150 --> 00:15:22,210
Stand up and speak.

293
00:15:25,750 --> 00:15:26,910
I am late.

294
00:15:27,260 --> 00:15:29,530
I failed to protect Your Highness.

295
00:15:30,260 --> 00:15:32,640
I deserve to die.

296
00:15:35,420 --> 00:15:36,800
You are a grown man.

297
00:15:37,890 --> 00:15:39,220
Why are you crying?

298
00:15:40,450 --> 00:15:41,100
Look.

299
00:15:41,790 --> 00:15:43,100
I am perfectly fine,

300
00:15:44,390 --> 00:15:45,460
aren't I?

301
00:15:50,410 --> 00:15:53,340
It's just that the Huliu explosive
is very powerful.

302
00:15:53,500 --> 00:15:54,270
Sanbao,

303
00:15:55,860 --> 00:15:57,320
you are not injured at all.

304
00:15:58,580 --> 00:16:00,860
Although I suffered some impact,

305
00:16:00,860 --> 00:16:01,950
I am fine.

306
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:02,940
Your Highness,

307
00:16:02,980 --> 00:16:04,440
please allow me to report.

308
00:16:05,430 --> 00:16:07,360
The rebels bombed my treasure ship

309
00:16:08,820 --> 00:16:10,750
with Huliu explosive, do you know?

310
00:16:11,810 --> 00:16:12,580
I know.

311
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:14,820
And do you know

312
00:16:15,100 --> 00:16:16,100
where they got it?

313
00:16:16,910 --> 00:16:19,190
A few days ago, in Jinling Palace,

314
00:16:19,210 --> 00:16:21,610
a batch of Huliu explosive
was indeed lost.

315
00:16:32,730 --> 00:16:34,220
Jinling. Jinling.

316
00:16:38,400 --> 00:16:40,210
Jinling is really something.

317
00:16:43,340 --> 00:16:45,070
I haven't even set foot ashore,

318
00:16:45,620 --> 00:16:48,150
and they've already dealt me such a blow.

319
00:16:48,450 --> 00:16:49,790
It was my negligence.

320
00:16:50,150 --> 00:16:50,700
I...

321
00:16:57,550 --> 00:16:58,100
Alright.

322
00:16:58,620 --> 00:17:00,340
Don't blame yourself anymore.

323
00:17:00,340 --> 00:17:02,140
Since you are unharmed, Sanbao,

324
00:17:02,950 --> 00:17:04,150
that's the best.

325
00:17:11,910 --> 00:17:13,430
The culprits won't stop

326
00:17:13,690 --> 00:17:15,430
until they see me dead.

327
00:17:15,890 --> 00:17:18,040
We can't even be sure there aren't spies

328
00:17:18,040 --> 00:17:20,390
among the Imperial Guards.

329
00:17:21,260 --> 00:17:22,119
Your Highness,

330
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:23,950
earlier,

331
00:17:24,280 --> 00:17:27,220
I discussed this with Zhu Buhua,
the eunuch overseeing the Imperial Stables.

332
00:17:27,220 --> 00:17:29,150
We agreed to guard separate locations.

333
00:17:29,150 --> 00:17:31,390
He's keeping cavalry from the Brave Warriors Camp
stationed at the Imperial City

334
00:17:31,390 --> 00:17:32,520
in case of emergency.

335
00:17:32,520 --> 00:17:33,190
He should

336
00:17:33,950 --> 00:17:37,480
send someone to escort Your Highness
back to the palace safely.

337
00:17:39,280 --> 00:17:39,950
Sanbao,

338
00:17:40,630 --> 00:17:42,490
How long have you been in Jinling?

339
00:17:43,350 --> 00:17:44,550
Less than half a year.

340
00:17:45,650 --> 00:17:46,850
Less than half a year?

341
00:17:47,520 --> 00:17:48,350
Then tell me,

342
00:17:48,430 --> 00:17:49,670
where is safe

343
00:17:50,170 --> 00:17:51,780
in this city?

344
00:17:56,170 --> 00:17:57,020
I know

345
00:17:58,190 --> 00:18:00,320
this matter has nothing to do with you.

346
00:18:01,910 --> 00:18:03,020
You just said

347
00:18:03,430 --> 00:18:05,700
you want to escort me
back to the Imperial Palace, right?

348
00:18:05,700 --> 00:18:06,300
Yes.

349
00:18:07,780 --> 00:18:09,510
Arrange it as soon as possible.

350
00:18:11,300 --> 00:18:12,540
I want to see

351
00:18:13,300 --> 00:18:15,590
who wants to kill me so badly.

352
00:18:23,590 --> 00:18:25,060
Emperor Taizong above,

353
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:26,950
I, Tuotuo Buhua,

354
00:18:27,280 --> 00:18:31,140
was granted the surname Zhu
by Emperor Taizong to serve in the palace.

355
00:18:31,760 --> 00:18:33,390
Now His Highness...

356
00:18:34,810 --> 00:18:36,620
[Zhu Buhua, Chief Eunuch of
the Directorate of the Imperial Stables]

357
00:18:55,800 --> 00:18:56,540
I am guilty.

358
00:18:57,430 --> 00:18:59,830
I will tell the truth.
I will tell the truth.

359
00:19:02,870 --> 00:19:03,530
Godfather.

360
00:19:03,960 --> 00:19:05,020
Lord Zheng has sent orders.

361
00:19:05,020 --> 00:19:06,020
You are to lead the Brave Warriors Camp

362
00:19:06,020 --> 00:19:09,390
to the Commandant's Office immediately
to escort the Crown Prince.

363
00:19:09,390 --> 00:19:10,320
What did you say?

364
00:19:10,330 --> 00:19:11,060
Lord Zheng

365
00:19:11,650 --> 00:19:13,830
orders you to go to
the Commandant's Office

366
00:19:13,830 --> 00:19:15,430
at once to escort the Crown Prince.

367
00:19:15,430 --> 00:19:16,090
Lord Envoy.

368
00:19:17,470 --> 00:19:20,470
The Crown Prince is not dead.
Go back to the palace now.

369
00:19:41,650 --> 00:19:44,220
I, Zhu Buhua, Eunuch Director
of the Imperial Horse Directorate,

370
00:19:44,220 --> 00:19:45,340
am late to the rescue.

371
00:19:45,340 --> 00:19:47,270
Please forgive me, Your Highness!

372
00:19:50,200 --> 00:19:51,670
Rise, Zhu Buhua.

373
00:19:51,960 --> 00:19:53,080
This is an emergency.

374
00:19:53,080 --> 00:19:54,680
This is not the place to talk.

375
00:19:55,520 --> 00:19:58,050
Lead the Brave Warriors Camp
to clear the way.

376
00:19:58,150 --> 00:19:59,010
Whatever it is,

377
00:19:59,260 --> 00:20:01,430
we'll talk when we get back to the palace.

378
00:20:01,430 --> 00:20:02,560
Yes, Your Highness.

379
00:20:42,870 --> 00:20:43,530
Don't move!

380
00:20:44,060 --> 00:20:45,460
If you stop making a fuss,

381
00:20:46,060 --> 00:20:47,780
I can take this cloth off.

382
00:20:52,700 --> 00:20:54,360
Just go to the palace quietly.

383
00:20:54,850 --> 00:20:56,780
This is the Crown Prince's sedan chair,

384
00:20:56,780 --> 00:20:58,020
the safest place.

385
00:20:58,460 --> 00:21:00,590
There are guards everywhere outside.

386
00:21:00,910 --> 00:21:02,240
If you make a fuss again,

387
00:21:02,370 --> 00:21:03,560
don't blame me for being rude.

388
00:21:03,560 --> 00:21:04,910
Don't give me that.

389
00:21:05,800 --> 00:21:07,980
My entire family works for
the Yingtian Prefectural Office.

390
00:21:07,980 --> 00:21:09,390
I've seen it all.

391
00:21:10,480 --> 00:21:11,680
You got so many guards

392
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:13,020
to cover for you,

393
00:21:13,220 --> 00:21:15,040
and show such a stupid sedan chair

394
00:21:15,040 --> 00:21:15,800
as a target.

395
00:21:16,090 --> 00:21:17,620
Do you think I know nothing?

396
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:20,370
The treasure ship
was safe enough, wasn't it?

397
00:21:20,370 --> 00:21:21,590
What happened in the end?

398
00:21:21,590 --> 00:21:22,720
It was blown to ashes!

399
00:21:22,720 --> 00:21:23,740
Do your job if you can.

400
00:21:23,740 --> 00:21:26,070
If you can't, fulfill your duty
to the end.

401
00:21:26,370 --> 00:21:28,300
You work for
the Yingtian Prefectural Office.

402
00:21:28,300 --> 00:21:29,500
This is your job.

403
00:21:31,760 --> 00:21:34,360
As long as Lord Shen
makes it back to the palace,

404
00:21:34,450 --> 00:21:35,980
I'd gladly give my life

405
00:21:36,630 --> 00:21:37,830
for him.

406
00:21:39,220 --> 00:21:40,630
Lord Shen, huh?

407
00:21:40,850 --> 00:21:41,870
Lord Shen?

408
00:21:42,540 --> 00:21:44,210
Do you really think I'm stupid?

409
00:21:44,210 --> 00:21:45,940
He is clearly the Crown Prince!

410
00:21:47,660 --> 00:21:49,050
If I'm not mistaken,

411
00:21:49,640 --> 00:21:50,960
you must be Lord Zheng.

412
00:21:54,670 --> 00:21:56,070
Still trying to trick me?

413
00:21:56,930 --> 00:21:58,110
If you want to die,

414
00:21:58,150 --> 00:21:59,390
don't drag me down with you.

415
00:21:59,390 --> 00:22:00,540
I don't want to.

416
00:22:09,780 --> 00:22:10,710
I want to get out!

417
00:22:11,540 --> 00:22:11,980
You...

418
00:22:12,170 --> 00:22:13,300
You little rascal!

419
00:22:13,460 --> 00:22:15,390
You really know how to put on an act!

420
00:22:18,700 --> 00:22:19,740
Help!

421
00:22:19,980 --> 00:22:20,460
Help!

422
00:23:41,720 --> 00:23:43,430
Retreat! Retreat!

423
00:23:43,980 --> 00:23:45,130
Retreat!

424
00:24:28,590 --> 00:24:29,250
Godfather!

425
00:24:30,200 --> 00:24:30,870
Follow me!

426
00:24:31,080 --> 00:24:31,650
Go!

427
00:24:57,950 --> 00:24:58,610
Help me!

428
00:24:58,610 --> 00:24:59,940
Figure it out yourself.

429
00:25:00,970 --> 00:25:01,830
Your Highness!

430
00:25:08,640 --> 00:25:09,500
Your Highness!

431
00:25:15,020 --> 00:25:15,880
Your Highness!

432
00:25:31,040 --> 00:25:32,430
Help me!

433
00:25:32,740 --> 00:25:34,090
Help!

434
00:25:35,700 --> 00:25:36,740
Help!

435
00:25:38,830 --> 00:25:40,020
Help!

436
00:25:40,800 --> 00:25:43,120
Get me down!

437
00:25:50,370 --> 00:25:51,540
Danger, Your Highness!

438
00:25:51,540 --> 00:25:52,150
Get away!

439
00:25:53,430 --> 00:25:54,200
Your Highness.

440
00:25:54,200 --> 00:25:55,630
The bridge could collapse at any moment!

441
00:25:55,630 --> 00:25:57,290
Please retreat immediately!

442
00:26:00,130 --> 00:26:01,190
What are you doing?

443
00:26:01,560 --> 00:26:02,430
Don't mess around!

444
00:26:02,430 --> 00:26:03,430
I saved your life!

445
00:26:05,020 --> 00:26:06,280
Don't act recklessly!

446
00:26:12,260 --> 00:26:13,190
Calm down!

447
00:26:14,390 --> 00:26:15,700
I offended you before.

448
00:26:16,330 --> 00:26:17,590
Please be the bigger person!

449
00:26:17,590 --> 00:26:18,520
I was wrong!

450
00:26:18,870 --> 00:26:19,910
I was wrong!

451
00:26:20,980 --> 00:26:22,150
I was wrong.

452
00:26:22,460 --> 00:26:24,020
Father sent word

453
00:26:24,460 --> 00:26:26,060
that all the officials
from Yingtian Prefecture

454
00:26:26,060 --> 00:26:27,860
were wiped out at Dongshui Pass.

455
00:26:27,890 --> 00:26:29,430
The one who is truly famous

456
00:26:29,930 --> 00:26:31,330
is his father, Iron Lion—

457
00:26:31,720 --> 00:26:33,680
Wu Buping, chief constable overseeing

458
00:26:33,680 --> 00:26:34,880
all three divisions
of the Yingtian Prefecture.

459
00:26:34,880 --> 00:26:36,110
Let me go quickly!

460
00:26:38,070 --> 00:26:39,850
You will definitely need me.

461
00:26:44,630 --> 00:26:45,980
No!

462
00:27:00,330 --> 00:27:01,140
Your Highness,

463
00:27:01,140 --> 00:27:03,980
I feel there is something
very suspicious about this.

464
00:27:03,980 --> 00:27:04,590
Speak.

465
00:27:05,250 --> 00:27:06,480
The culprits could've timed the attack

466
00:27:06,480 --> 00:27:08,010
on the Crown Prince's ship,

467
00:27:08,200 --> 00:27:10,200
but they couldn't possibly have known

468
00:27:10,200 --> 00:27:11,500
when you would cross Xuanjin Bridge.

469
00:27:11,500 --> 00:27:13,230
And how could they have brought

470
00:27:13,480 --> 00:27:14,800
so much Huliu explosive here

471
00:27:14,800 --> 00:27:15,700
at once?

472
00:27:15,720 --> 00:27:17,250
It's not hard to figure out.

473
00:27:19,500 --> 00:27:21,360
This is a trap they set in advance.

474
00:27:21,650 --> 00:27:22,890
The person who lit the fire

475
00:27:22,890 --> 00:27:24,090
must still be nearby.

476
00:27:24,410 --> 00:27:24,950
Search!

477
00:27:29,650 --> 00:27:30,430
Your Highness.

478
00:27:30,430 --> 00:27:31,520
Let's retreat quickly!

479
00:27:31,520 --> 00:27:33,180
This bridge is too dangerous.

480
00:27:33,460 --> 00:27:35,120
There's someone downstream!

481
00:27:49,750 --> 00:27:50,540
Keep him alive.

482
00:27:50,540 --> 00:27:51,040
Catch him!

483
00:27:51,040 --> 00:27:51,980
Keep him alive!

484
00:28:09,700 --> 00:28:11,090
His Highness said that take him alive!

485
00:28:11,090 --> 00:28:12,300
What are you waiting for?

486
00:28:12,300 --> 00:28:12,910
Chase him!

487
00:28:15,020 --> 00:28:15,740
Hurry!

488
00:28:17,690 --> 00:28:18,460
You guys!

489
00:28:18,520 --> 00:28:19,650
Come with me! Hurry!

490
00:28:40,840 --> 00:28:41,580
Put him down.

491
00:28:58,780 --> 00:28:59,690
Iron Alliance.

492
00:29:10,630 --> 00:29:13,230
There are still remnants
of the Iron Alliance.

493
00:29:28,590 --> 00:29:32,350
[Zuo Yehe, Envoy of the Iron Alliance]

494
00:29:28,630 --> 00:29:29,220
Envoy.

495
00:29:29,700 --> 00:29:30,300
Envoy.

496
00:29:30,950 --> 00:29:32,090
With all that Huliu explosive,

497
00:29:32,090 --> 00:29:33,490
it still didn't kill him?

498
00:29:33,670 --> 00:29:34,670
He got away again?

499
00:29:37,530 --> 00:29:39,660
Just consider the Crown Prince lucky.

500
00:29:41,930 --> 00:29:42,670
Our men

501
00:29:42,910 --> 00:29:44,440
are either dead or injured.

502
00:29:49,390 --> 00:29:51,020
If the Crown Prince
makes it back to the palace,

503
00:29:51,020 --> 00:29:53,150
we won't have a chance to deal with him.

504
00:29:56,930 --> 00:29:57,540
Envoy.

505
00:29:57,780 --> 00:29:59,430
We can't always be the scapegoat.

506
00:29:59,430 --> 00:30:00,910
Stop hovering around me!

507
00:30:01,700 --> 00:30:03,300
You're getting on my nerves.

508
00:30:03,350 --> 00:30:04,210
Sit over there!

509
00:30:11,240 --> 00:30:12,500
In my opinion,

510
00:30:13,110 --> 00:30:15,640
it's a good thing the Crown Prince
isn't dead.

511
00:30:23,300 --> 00:30:25,830
As long as the Crown Prince
enters the palace,

512
00:30:26,590 --> 00:30:28,390
someone else will deal with him.

513
00:30:29,020 --> 00:30:30,700
Once the Crown Prince is dead,

514
00:30:32,460 --> 00:30:34,260
they won't be able to pin it on us.

515
00:30:34,740 --> 00:30:36,390
We don't need a scapegoat.

516
00:30:38,150 --> 00:30:39,150
You are right.

517
00:30:41,520 --> 00:30:43,720
Have you found the Iron Lion, Wu Buping?

518
00:30:44,670 --> 00:30:45,150
Not yet.

519
00:30:45,150 --> 00:30:47,010
Then send someone out to find him.

520
00:30:47,240 --> 00:30:49,310
As long as we keep him under our control,

521
00:30:49,310 --> 00:30:51,810
things will be much easier
for us, won't they?

522
00:30:51,810 --> 00:30:53,600
Okay, I'll get on it right away.

523
00:30:56,860 --> 00:30:59,080
[Fule Brothel]

524
00:31:17,370 --> 00:31:18,150
Granny Tong.

525
00:31:18,890 --> 00:31:21,200
I want to take Hongyu away from Jinling.

526
00:31:21,480 --> 00:31:23,800
[Granny Tong, Fule Brothel]

527
00:31:21,650 --> 00:31:22,560
Without an official pardon,

528
00:31:22,560 --> 00:31:24,020
she can't buy her freedom.

529
00:31:25,190 --> 00:31:26,300
After all these years,

530
00:31:26,300 --> 00:31:27,960
do you think you can just sweep

531
00:31:28,510 --> 00:31:31,370
what happened
between you and Hongyu under the rug?

532
00:31:31,910 --> 00:31:33,710
Do you think I can let that slide?

533
00:31:33,930 --> 00:31:35,330
This little bit of silver

534
00:31:35,540 --> 00:31:38,070
won't even cover
the deficit in the accounts.

535
00:31:39,530 --> 00:31:40,590
Alright, alright.

536
00:31:41,020 --> 00:31:41,750
Granny Tong.

537
00:31:42,740 --> 00:31:45,060
You... you name a price.

538
00:31:47,050 --> 00:31:51,040
[Hong Yu, Musician at Fule Brothel]

539
00:31:48,290 --> 00:31:49,420
Two thousand taels.

540
00:32:02,250 --> 00:32:05,140
[Yingtian Prefecture]

541
00:32:06,330 --> 00:32:07,260
Have you seen my dad?

542
00:32:07,260 --> 00:32:08,460
Isn't he right there?

543
00:32:09,890 --> 00:32:11,910
[We have your daughter.]

544
00:32:13,150 --> 00:32:13,670
Dad.

545
00:32:14,310 --> 00:32:15,770
Let me tell you something.

546
00:32:16,740 --> 00:32:18,430
Why are you soaking wet?

547
00:32:18,610 --> 00:32:20,340
Did you fall into the water too?

548
00:32:21,150 --> 00:32:22,540
No, this... this is not important.

549
00:32:22,540 --> 00:32:23,780
I have something important to tell you.

550
00:32:23,780 --> 00:32:24,760
No, I don't have time right now.

551
00:32:24,760 --> 00:32:25,760
You go home first.

552
00:32:26,110 --> 00:32:28,110
But it's really important!

553
00:32:28,380 --> 00:32:29,760
This is serious.

554
00:32:31,950 --> 00:32:33,220
Guess who I saved?

555
00:32:33,840 --> 00:32:34,840
The Crown Prince.

556
00:32:35,240 --> 00:32:36,500
It's a big deal, right?

557
00:32:38,600 --> 00:32:40,200
Can you stop talking nonsense?

558
00:32:40,200 --> 00:32:40,870
Go home now!

559
00:32:41,400 --> 00:32:42,860
I'm not talking nonsense.

560
00:32:42,960 --> 00:32:44,370
Would I lie to you about this?

561
00:32:44,370 --> 00:32:45,430
Yulu can testify.

562
00:32:46,010 --> 00:32:46,740
Your sister?

563
00:32:47,590 --> 00:32:48,790
Where did she see her?

564
00:32:50,390 --> 00:32:51,450
I brought the Crown Prince

565
00:32:51,450 --> 00:32:53,670
from Shangutai to Tongji Gate.

566
00:32:53,740 --> 00:32:55,140
Where is your sister now?

567
00:32:55,330 --> 00:32:56,590
Where did she go later?

568
00:32:57,190 --> 00:32:58,690
I'm talking about the Crown Prince.

569
00:32:58,690 --> 00:32:59,590
Why do you keep mentioning my sister?

570
00:32:59,590 --> 00:33:00,480
Tell me,

571
00:33:00,480 --> 00:33:02,140
did you see your sister later?

572
00:33:02,260 --> 00:33:02,800
No.

573
00:33:03,500 --> 00:33:04,300
What's wrong?

574
00:33:04,560 --> 00:33:05,820
What happened to Yulu?

575
00:33:06,440 --> 00:33:08,330
Nothing. I'm just asking.

576
00:33:09,910 --> 00:33:10,350
Come.

577
00:33:10,590 --> 00:33:11,260
Listen.

578
00:33:11,930 --> 00:33:13,020
After I handed the Crown Prince

579
00:33:13,020 --> 00:33:14,350
to the Imperial Guards,

580
00:33:15,400 --> 00:33:16,540
guess what happened?

581
00:33:16,540 --> 00:33:18,370
I don't have time
for guessing games right now.

582
00:33:18,370 --> 00:33:19,350
You...

583
00:33:19,370 --> 00:33:20,330
hurry home.

584
00:33:20,780 --> 00:33:21,440
Tonight...

585
00:33:22,150 --> 00:33:23,700
I'll guess when I get home tonight,

586
00:33:23,700 --> 00:33:24,220
okay?

587
00:33:25,520 --> 00:33:26,060
Wait.

588
00:33:26,480 --> 00:33:27,190
This man...

589
00:34:02,930 --> 00:34:03,790
Your Highness.

590
00:34:04,020 --> 00:34:05,820
Shall I have the meal served now?

591
00:34:06,020 --> 00:34:07,080
By imperial order,

592
00:34:07,350 --> 00:34:09,350
Messenger Director
of the Messenger's Office, Yu Qian,

593
00:34:09,350 --> 00:34:10,760
is to enter the palace
for an audience immediately.

594
00:34:10,760 --> 00:34:12,020
No delay is permitted.

595
00:34:12,060 --> 00:34:12,620
Yes.

596
00:34:14,060 --> 00:34:15,520
Have I finished speaking?

597
00:34:17,030 --> 00:34:17,920
I was wrong.

598
00:34:18,159 --> 00:34:20,090
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

599
00:34:21,449 --> 00:34:22,500
By imperial order,

600
00:34:22,500 --> 00:34:25,020
I, Zhu Buhua, Eunuch Director
of the Imperial Horse Directorate,

601
00:34:25,020 --> 00:34:27,350
is to enter the palace for an audience
at the beginning of the Hai hour today.

602
00:34:27,350 --> 00:34:27,909
Yes.

603
00:34:28,409 --> 00:34:29,159
By imperial order,

604
00:34:29,159 --> 00:34:31,409
Yuan Zhongda, Chief Minister
of the Court of Imperial Sacrifices,

605
00:34:31,409 --> 00:34:32,600
is to enter the palace for an audience

606
00:34:32,600 --> 00:34:34,310
at the beginning
of the Chen hour tomorrow.

607
00:34:34,310 --> 00:34:34,870
Yes.

608
00:34:35,370 --> 00:34:38,290
Wear official court robes.
No full court audience is to be held.

609
00:34:38,290 --> 00:34:39,949
Tell each person summoned
for an audience that,

610
00:34:39,949 --> 00:34:42,909
because of the sensitive nature
of the matter, he must enter alone.

611
00:34:42,909 --> 00:34:44,040
I will receive no one

612
00:34:44,250 --> 00:34:45,380
other than those summoned.

613
00:34:45,380 --> 00:34:45,929
Yes.

614
00:35:08,830 --> 00:35:10,230
How exactly did Zhu Buhua

615
00:35:13,060 --> 00:35:14,620
teach him?

616
00:35:16,230 --> 00:35:17,760
In this secondary capital,

617
00:35:19,430 --> 00:35:23,490
not a soul seems to underst and
proper conduct between ruler and subject.

618
00:36:10,720 --> 00:36:11,840
Stop following me.

619
00:36:12,580 --> 00:36:14,830
I'm going to the Palace Firewood Service

620
00:36:14,830 --> 00:36:17,630
to find some wood to make
a memorial tablet for my companion.

621
00:36:17,630 --> 00:36:19,030
E-Eunuch Zhu ordered us

622
00:36:19,330 --> 00:36:20,600
that to ensure Your Highness's safety,

623
00:36:20,600 --> 00:36:23,060
we must not leave your side
for a single step.

624
00:36:25,900 --> 00:36:27,370
So you mean

625
00:36:28,580 --> 00:36:29,750
what Eunuch Zhu says

626
00:36:29,770 --> 00:36:31,000
is an imperial edict?

627
00:36:33,980 --> 00:36:36,180
What you just said is a capital offense.

628
00:36:36,800 --> 00:36:38,660
For the sake of my companion Wang,

629
00:36:38,730 --> 00:36:40,190
I will spare you this time.

630
00:36:40,390 --> 00:36:41,430
Get lost.

631
00:36:44,960 --> 00:36:45,980
Are you deaf?

632
00:36:57,600 --> 00:36:59,330
If that rebel
who was shot with an arrow

633
00:36:59,330 --> 00:37:01,590
is really a remnant of the Iron Alliance,

634
00:37:02,850 --> 00:37:04,430
this madness of slaughtering

635
00:37:04,430 --> 00:37:06,140
both me and the entire court

636
00:37:06,770 --> 00:37:07,950
would make sense.

637
00:37:09,210 --> 00:37:10,070
As far as I know,

638
00:37:10,790 --> 00:37:12,640
the last time the Iron Alliance
caused trouble

639
00:37:12,640 --> 00:37:14,300
was in the 18th year of Yongle.

640
00:37:14,870 --> 00:37:16,930
They started a rebellion in Shandong

641
00:37:16,950 --> 00:37:18,150
with great momentum.

642
00:37:18,600 --> 00:37:20,370
Emperor Taizong spent a lot of effort

643
00:37:20,370 --> 00:37:21,660
to suppress it.

644
00:37:22,660 --> 00:37:23,350
So

645
00:37:24,210 --> 00:37:25,870
the Iron Alliance and the imperial court

646
00:37:25,870 --> 00:37:27,930
have a long history of bitter enmity.

647
00:37:44,530 --> 00:37:45,360
Messenger Yu.

648
00:37:51,980 --> 00:37:53,310
Taste-test the dishes?

649
00:38:04,110 --> 00:38:05,040
Sit down and eat.

650
00:38:14,830 --> 00:38:15,580
I think

651
00:38:16,640 --> 00:38:17,460
the priority

652
00:38:17,580 --> 00:38:19,180
is to send a capable confidant

653
00:38:19,180 --> 00:38:20,770
to track down the real culprit.

654
00:38:20,770 --> 00:38:22,330
The rebels
have planned everything meticulously.

655
00:38:22,330 --> 00:38:23,660
If we hesitate or delay,

656
00:38:23,710 --> 00:38:25,240
I'm afraid in the future...

657
00:38:26,610 --> 00:38:27,550
Let me do it.

658
00:38:28,080 --> 00:38:28,770
Let me.

659
00:38:33,500 --> 00:38:34,910
What trusted aides?

660
00:38:37,540 --> 00:38:38,820
Then, Your Highness...

661
00:38:38,820 --> 00:38:41,020
do you not plan to trust anyone anymore?

662
00:38:47,350 --> 00:38:48,910
What do you think of

663
00:38:49,410 --> 00:38:50,540
that Good-for-Nothing?

664
00:38:50,540 --> 00:38:52,540
Who is Your Highness talking about?

665
00:38:52,910 --> 00:38:54,240
What was his name again?

666
00:38:54,410 --> 00:38:54,980
Right,

667
00:38:56,180 --> 00:38:57,350
Wu Dingyuan, right?

668
00:38:58,890 --> 00:38:59,770
Your Highness,

669
00:39:00,020 --> 00:39:02,060
he speaks without thinking
and behaves recklessly.

670
00:39:02,060 --> 00:39:03,750
He thinks he's clever

671
00:39:03,850 --> 00:39:05,770
and keeps showing you disrespect.

672
00:39:05,770 --> 00:39:07,230
He is absolutely untrustworthy.

673
00:39:07,230 --> 00:39:07,830
Besides,

674
00:39:08,750 --> 00:39:10,080
he has already run away.

675
00:39:10,890 --> 00:39:11,580
He ran away.

676
00:39:12,270 --> 00:39:15,130
Although he has shown me
disrespect time and again,

677
00:39:15,230 --> 00:39:16,390
he saved me.

678
00:39:17,310 --> 00:39:19,270
It's true he saved Your Highness,

679
00:39:20,460 --> 00:39:22,270
but he's using the fact
that he saved you

680
00:39:22,270 --> 00:39:23,750
to pursue his own interests,
putting Your Highness

681
00:39:23,750 --> 00:39:25,010
at risk in the process.

682
00:39:25,500 --> 00:39:27,140
This is unforgivable.

683
00:39:27,450 --> 00:39:29,020
But when he saved me,

684
00:39:29,620 --> 00:39:31,680
he didn't know I was the Crown Prince.

685
00:39:35,040 --> 00:39:35,580
Here,

686
00:39:36,410 --> 00:39:37,470
so you don't choke.

687
00:39:40,560 --> 00:39:42,020
Thank you, Your Highness.

688
00:39:42,620 --> 00:39:43,540
Wu Dingyuan

689
00:39:43,950 --> 00:39:44,790
is just

690
00:39:46,000 --> 00:39:47,460
a constable after all.

691
00:39:47,980 --> 00:39:49,180
For such a major case,

692
00:39:49,250 --> 00:39:50,850
I'm afraid he's not capable.

693
00:39:51,080 --> 00:39:53,950
Why don't you order Wu Dingyuan's father,

694
00:39:54,630 --> 00:39:57,270
Wu Buping, the chief constable
of Yingtian Prefecture,

695
00:39:57,270 --> 00:40:00,540
to investigate this case?

696
00:40:00,810 --> 00:40:02,370
I believe this would give us
a better chance of success.

697
00:40:02,370 --> 00:40:03,300
In Jinling City,

698
00:40:03,540 --> 00:40:05,800
there is no case this person can't solve.

699
00:40:06,430 --> 00:40:08,580
If we hand this case to Wu Buping,

700
00:40:08,790 --> 00:40:11,950
wouldn't that be the same as handing it
over to the Yingtian Prefectural Office?

701
00:40:11,950 --> 00:40:13,550
It will only alert the enemy.

702
00:40:13,560 --> 00:40:14,750
Let a petty schemer

703
00:40:14,910 --> 00:40:16,790
like Wu Dingyuan dea lwith

704
00:40:17,500 --> 00:40:19,330
those corrupt little rats.

705
00:40:19,830 --> 00:40:20,630
Messenger Yu,

706
00:40:21,060 --> 00:40:22,580
do you think I'm right?

707
00:40:26,100 --> 00:40:26,960
Your Highness,

708
00:40:27,180 --> 00:40:28,310
I think

709
00:40:28,460 --> 00:40:29,270
you may not

710
00:40:29,390 --> 00:40:30,950
firmly believe that Wu Dingyuan

711
00:40:30,950 --> 00:40:33,280
is capable of this important task, right?

712
00:40:34,850 --> 00:40:35,540
Yu Qian.

713
00:40:38,910 --> 00:40:41,620
I hereby appoint you Right Rectifier
of the Right Secretariat of the Heir Apparent,

714
00:40:41,620 --> 00:40:44,100
and assign you to investigate this case
alongside Wu Dingyuan

715
00:40:44,100 --> 00:40:45,560
and report directly to me.

716
00:40:50,790 --> 00:40:52,980
This is the token from Zheng Sanbao.

717
00:40:53,810 --> 00:40:54,460
Take it.

718
00:40:54,660 --> 00:40:55,950
It's more convenient for you

719
00:40:55,950 --> 00:40:57,500
to make things easier in Jinling.

720
00:40:57,500 --> 00:40:59,870
I won't let you down, Your Highness.

721
00:41:00,400 --> 00:41:02,460
That Good-for-Nothing loves money.

722
00:41:03,540 --> 00:41:05,430
Just give him whatever he wants.

723
00:41:06,660 --> 00:41:07,790
Yes, Your Highness.

724
00:41:08,640 --> 00:41:09,910
Did I tell you to rise?

725
00:41:12,730 --> 00:41:13,580
I was wrong.

726
00:41:14,460 --> 00:41:15,100
Is it good?

727
00:41:17,480 --> 00:41:19,440
You only picked your favorites.

728
00:41:19,560 --> 00:41:21,000
Those who don't know would think

729
00:41:21,000 --> 00:41:22,250
I was treating you.

730
00:41:27,100 --> 00:41:27,660
I...

731
00:41:27,730 --> 00:41:28,930
Stop being disloyal.

732
00:41:28,980 --> 00:41:29,580
Go.

733
00:41:31,810 --> 00:41:32,710
I shall take my leave.

734
00:41:32,710 --> 00:41:33,480
Hurry up.

735
00:41:46,470 --> 00:41:53,630
♪ To know the truth of one's heart,
listen to sincere advice ♪

736
00:42:30,570 --> 00:42:31,910
♪ Swaying along, swaying along ♪

737
00:42:31,930 --> 00:42:33,360
♪ Swaying along, swaying along ♪

738
00:42:33,380 --> 00:42:35,100
♪ Swaying along—
what's all the swaying for? ♪

739
00:42:36,030 --> 00:42:37,530
♪ Chasing them down, chasing them down ♪

740
00:42:37,560 --> 00:42:38,940
♪ Chasing them down, chasing them down ♪

741
00:42:38,960 --> 00:42:41,220
♪ Chasing them down—
what am I chasing for? ♪

742
00:42:41,760 --> 00:42:43,210
♪ Who knows? Who cares about me? ♪

743
00:42:43,230 --> 00:42:44,640
♪ Who knows? Who cares about me? ♪

744
00:42:44,660 --> 00:42:46,660
♪ Who knows where home is? ♪

745
00:42:47,190 --> 00:42:48,930
♪ To hell with princes and nobles ♪

746
00:42:48,960 --> 00:42:50,210
♪ To hell with
what the history books say ♪

747
00:42:50,240 --> 00:42:52,300
♪ I'm my own guardian angel ♪

748
00:42:50,520 --> 00:42:52,180
There's a saying at the yamen.

749
00:42:52,620 --> 00:42:53,950
Men fear the leg clamps;

750
00:42:54,260 --> 00:42:56,230
women fear the finger-crushing torture.

751
00:42:56,230 --> 00:42:57,430
I think that's wrong.

752
00:42:59,460 --> 00:43:01,310
Pain in your fingers hurts just as much,

753
00:43:01,310 --> 00:43:02,360
whether you're a man or a woman.

754
00:43:02,360 --> 00:43:04,690
Why do you have a blade
hidden in your boot?

755
00:43:06,120 --> 00:43:06,980
You won't talk?

756
00:43:07,750 --> 00:43:08,350
Alright.
